And you stick Juju in there and it gets even more perfect somehow!

254
00:15:38,700 --> 00:15:39,700
I can die happy!

255
00:15:39,700 --> 00:15:41,700
Fan service is your calling!

256
00:15:41,700 --> 00:15:43,700
Thanks, but pull it together.

257
00:15:43,700 --> 00:15:47,700
The fact that every piece of costume fits you so well is a miracle!

258
00:15:47,700 --> 00:15:48,700
Or witchcraft!

259
00:15:48,700 --> 00:15:49,700
Unfortunately neither.

260
00:15:49,700 --> 00:15:52,700
It's just a crap ton of staples.

261
00:15:52,700 --> 00:15:53,700
Well, Mia?

262
00:15:53,700 --> 00:15:56,700
Everybody's here, so you know what that means.

263
00:15:56,700 --> 00:15:57,700
Of course!

264
00:15:57,700 --> 00:15:58,700
Let's shoot this thing!

265
00:16:02,700 --> 00:16:04,700
Never let your height hold you back!

266
00:16:04,700 --> 00:16:06,700
Focus on portraits and chest-up shots!

267
00:16:06,700 --> 00:16:08,700
Show no feet, have no problems!

268
00:16:08,700 --> 00:16:13,700
If you want to show off your full body, take the photo from below!

269
00:16:13,700 --> 00:16:17,700
Keep your height a mystery by keeping background blank!

270
00:16:17,700 --> 00:16:20,700
As long as nothing in the shot reveals your proportions,

271
00:16:20,700 --> 00:16:22,700
they'll think you're a skyscraper!

272
00:16:22,700 --> 00:16:24,700
You're a genius, Miyako!

273
00:16:24,700 --> 00:16:25,700
Awesome tips!

274
00:16:25,700 --> 00:16:27,700
If you're tall and want to appear shorter,

275
00:16:27,700 --> 00:16:29,700
then take photos sitting down or from overhead.

276
00:16:29,700 --> 00:16:31,700
Don't be nervous about the coffin group tomorrow.

277
00:16:31,700 --> 00:16:34,700
Just relax and let the angles do the work.

278
00:16:34,700 --> 00:16:35,700
All right!

279
00:16:35,700 --> 00:16:40,700
What a sight.

280
00:16:44,700 --> 00:16:47,700
And super sketchy sight.

281
00:16:47,700 --> 00:16:49,700
Dang, Shinju!

282
00:16:49,700 --> 00:16:52,700
Your Soma-kun cosplay is so frickin' elite!

283
00:16:52,700 --> 00:16:55,700
You dude-face has literal goals!

284
00:16:55,700 --> 00:16:57,700
Miyako's like a magician with makeup!

285
00:16:57,700 --> 00:17:00,700
This Soma makeup is totally different from when Gojo did it,

286
00:17:00,700 --> 00:17:02,700
and both looks are so fab-o!

287
00:17:02,700 --> 00:17:05,700
You fund your cosplays with your allowance, right?

288
00:17:05,700 --> 00:17:06,700
Did you spend it all?

289
00:17:06,700 --> 00:17:07,700
Uh-oh!

290
00:17:07,700 --> 00:17:08,700
It's no problem!

291
00:17:08,700 --> 00:17:11,700
I worked hard to get better grades in all the subjects I struggle with,

292
00:17:11,700 --> 00:17:14,700
so my parents gave me extra money to spend!

293
00:17:14,700 --> 00:17:15,700
Who's a good girl?

294
00:17:15,700 --> 00:17:16,700
Adorable!

295
00:17:16,700 --> 00:17:17,700
Must protect baby!

296
00:17:17,700 --> 00:17:19,700
You look incredible too, Maureen.

297
00:17:19,700 --> 00:17:21,700
Can we please take a quick picture together?

298
00:17:21,700 --> 00:17:22,700
You read my mind!

299
00:17:22,700 --> 00:17:25,700
Let's get that sick lighting upstairs!

300
00:17:25,700 --> 00:17:27,700
I love how the movie explores Black Lobelia's past

301
00:17:27,700 --> 00:17:29,700
and shows her grow into the character we all know and love,

302
00:17:29,700 --> 00:17:32,700
but it would be a lie to say I wasn't a little distracted by how lovely Soma and Zakiya look.

303
00:17:32,700 --> 00:17:34,700
I mean, I thought they were face-out-pins alone were as hot as they got,

304
00:17:34,700 --> 00:17:36,700
but apparently I was like way off on that analysis because, oh my goodness,

305
00:17:36,700 --> 00:17:37,700
those boys are absolutely stunning with a camera off!

306
00:17:37,700 --> 00:17:41,700
Miyako, Suzuka, I can't thank you enough.

307
00:17:41,700 --> 00:17:44,700
Cosplaying Black Lobelia was a dream come true.

308
00:17:44,700 --> 00:17:46,700
We should be thanking you.

309
00:17:46,700 --> 00:17:49,700
We were both dying to see you decked out in the costume.

310
00:17:49,700 --> 00:17:50,700
Absolutely!

311
00:17:50,700 --> 00:17:53,700
So thank you for indulging us.

312
00:17:54,700 --> 00:17:58,700
The truth is, I was going to give up cosplay.

313
00:18:00,700 --> 00:18:04,700
Sure, I enjoy it, but I figured I would have to quit someday.

314
00:18:05,700 --> 00:18:08,700
Why did you think that? Did your parents say something?

315
00:18:08,700 --> 00:18:12,700
No, everyone in my life is nothing but supportive and kind.

316
00:18:12,700 --> 00:18:16,700
Cosplay lets me become the characters I've admired since I was a child.

317
00:18:16,700 --> 00:18:18,700
It makes me truly happy.

318
00:18:18,700 --> 00:18:21,700
Regardless, there's something in the back of my mind.

319
00:18:21,700 --> 00:18:24,700
It's high time I let you in on a little secret.

320
00:18:24,700 --> 00:18:27,700
No happiness in life can last forever.

321
00:18:28,700 --> 00:18:31,700
I wondered how long I'd be allowed to continue.

322
00:18:31,700 --> 00:18:36,700
I don't go to cosplay events, and I've been cosplaying alone for ages now.

323
00:18:36,700 --> 00:18:39,700
I've never had the chance to talk to older cosplayers.

324
00:18:39,700 --> 00:18:46,700
But since meeting you, Miyako, I've realized cosplay is a hobby for everyone.

325
00:18:46,700 --> 00:18:48,700
Including adults.

326
00:18:48,700 --> 00:18:49,700
No, don't make me feel ancient.

327
00:18:49,700 --> 00:18:52,700
There are loads of people decades older than us that cosplay too.

328
00:18:52,700 --> 00:18:54,700
I had no idea.

329
00:18:54,700 --> 00:18:58,700
I know this mom who's about 40 and still cosplays the cutest idols.

330
00:18:58,700 --> 00:19:00,700
How do you do, fellow kids?

331
00:19:00,700 --> 00:19:01,700
Huh?

332
00:19:01,700 --> 00:19:06,700
I know this one dude in his 50s who can put together a kick-butt hero cosplay.

333
00:19:06,700 --> 00:19:08,700
He's loved heroes ever since he was a kid.

334
00:19:08,700 --> 00:19:12,700
With most things, there's this stigma that you have to do it while you're still young.

335
00:19:12,700 --> 00:19:15,700
But humans are adults for the vast majority of our lives.

336
00:19:15,700 --> 00:19:18,700
And it would be a huge waste of those lives not to do what we love.

337
00:19:18,700 --> 00:19:22,700
If something matters to you, then you can chase it for as long as you want.

338
00:19:22,700 --> 00:19:24,700
Starting late is cool too.

339
00:19:24,700 --> 00:19:26,700
Who really cares about age?

340
00:19:26,700 --> 00:19:27,700
Come on.

341
00:19:27,700 --> 00:19:29,700
We'll cosplay ourselves out to pasture.

342
00:19:29,700 --> 00:19:31,700
Happiness is a must for survival.

343
00:19:31,700 --> 00:19:33,700
A hundred percent.

344
00:19:33,700 --> 00:19:35,700
Cosplay is pure joy.

345
00:19:35,700 --> 00:19:38,700
Wrinkles won't make me ditch that.

346
00:19:38,700 --> 00:19:42,700
I'll let you in on one more big fat grown-up secret.

347
00:19:44,700 --> 00:19:47,700
Truth is, being an adult is epic.

348
00:19:47,700 --> 00:19:50,700
After all that scrounging, you have real adult money to spend.

349
00:19:50,700 --> 00:19:53,700
You definitely have less free time, but it's worth it.

350
00:19:53,700 --> 00:19:56,700
The power of money gives you so much fun stuff to do.

351
00:19:56,700 --> 00:19:58,700
But, uh, I have trouble budgeting.

352
00:19:58,700 --> 00:20:00,700
So I'll wait on my paychecks.

353
00:20:00,700 --> 00:20:03,700
There have been times when I thought someone stole my credit card info,

354
00:20:03,700 --> 00:20:06,700
but it was actually me on a spending spree and I totally blanked out.

355
00:20:06,700 --> 00:20:09,700
Why make the money if you're not gonna spend it, right?

356
00:20:14,700 --> 00:20:18,700
You talk about being adults, but it sounds like you're both still kids to me.

357
00:20:20,700 --> 00:20:23,700
Yeah, we suck as adults.

358
00:20:23,700 --> 00:20:26,700
Whatever. Happiness is priceless.

359
00:20:30,700 --> 00:20:35,700
What you said, the way you feel about Miyako and Suzuka, I get it.

360
00:20:36,700 --> 00:20:38,700
I feel the same way.

361
00:20:38,700 --> 00:20:42,700
I'm going to do everything in my power to make Kitakawa's dreams come true.

362
00:20:42,700 --> 00:20:44,700
It's the least I can do.

363
00:20:44,700 --> 00:20:45,700
It is.

364
00:20:47,700 --> 00:20:48,700
Right.

365
00:21:00,700 --> 00:21:03,700
It gets the Maureen's stamp of approval?

366
00:21:04,700 --> 00:21:06,700
Uh, Mom's calling to check in.

367
00:21:06,700 --> 00:21:08,700
Guess what? The takuyaki is a hint!

368
00:21:08,700 --> 00:21:13,700
Hm? Hang on. Weird. Why didn't Akira come today?

369
00:21:13,700 --> 00:21:14,540
to come today.

370
00:21:15,720 --> 00:21:17,460
Aki's way too busy making props

371
00:21:17,460 --> 00:21:20,200
