372
00:21:20,200 --> 00:21:21,540
Show it straight, please.

373
00:21:21,540 --> 00:21:23,980
Does Akira just not lick me or something?

374
00:21:23,980 --> 00:21:25,060
What an awful idea!

375
00:21:25,060 --> 00:21:27,980
How did you possibly come up with such a peculiar motion?

376
00:21:27,980 --> 00:21:30,680
When I came back from the bathroom at karaoke,

377
00:21:30,680 --> 00:21:33,680
I saw her chatting with you guys and being totally chill.

378
00:21:33,680 --> 00:21:35,180
She didn't make a peep when I was there,

379
00:21:35,180 --> 00:21:37,180
so I assumed I was the problem.

380
00:21:37,180 --> 00:21:38,340
Was I right?

381
00:21:38,340 --> 00:21:41,700
Ah, it's funny you mention that because she actually...

382
00:21:41,700 --> 00:21:43,500
Who cares if someone hates you?

383
00:21:43,700 --> 00:21:45,040
You can't change your personality,

384
00:21:45,040 --> 00:21:46,300
so just accept it.

385
00:21:48,120 --> 00:21:50,500
There's nothing funny about that!

386
00:21:50,500 --> 00:21:52,420
I'm not the type to let it bug me.

387
00:21:52,420 --> 00:21:54,660
I like pretty much everything and everyone.

388
00:21:57,840 --> 00:21:59,680
We're super sorry, Mari.

